WEBVTT

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:09.220
The memories of times past will be dyed
the colors of reminiscence some day.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:14.870
Sometimes they will
fade into monotone scenes.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:21.520
However, it only makes
those memories purer.

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:28.060
The reflections remain as
vivid as if it were yesterday.

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:33.470
Tokiwa University

00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:59.570
This one's worn out too!

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.390
Things are piling up because no
one ever cleans up back here.

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:10.730
The 35th year of Showa? (1960)

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:12.670
Sepia Colored Portrait,
Tokiwa University, Director: Oshima

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:14.550
Sepia Colored Portrait,
Tokiwa University, Director: Oshima
This is probably the private
property of some club.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:14.650
Sepia Colored Portrait,
Tokiwa University, Director: Oshima

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:16.690
Sepia Colored Portrait,
Tokiwa University, Director: Oshima
Don't they know this is a storage
facility, not a junk yard!

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:17.010
Sepia Colored Portrait,
Tokiwa University, Director: Oshima

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.450
I guess we can dump this.

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:38.350
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.300
and lead them to ruin.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:48.290
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:55.840
However, there are stray Shinma that
live secretly in the human world.

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:59.980
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:06.710
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:12.190
is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:16.790
No one knows her true face.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:43.790
There are times when I dream.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:48.400
It's a dream a few decades from
now and I am an old man.

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:53.130
What kind of life do you have
in this future dream?

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:55.260
It's the same as now.

00:03:55.970 --> 00:04:00.130
I'm still someone who refuses to see
reality and indulges in imagination.

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:07.170
But wouldn't that be wonderful?
Living forever with our dream.

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.190
In the dream I see...

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:12.530
Yes?

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:18.820
No... it's nothing.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.100
Thank you very much.

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:42.250
Mr. Oshima, thank you so much
for inviting us.

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:44.780
You are...
from the Tokiwa school?

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:46.380
I'm Aoki.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:48.820
I came here representing the
library committee.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:50.460
These are my friends.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:51.790
- Hi!
- Hello!

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:53.780
Mr. Oshima is a
graduate of our school...

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.620
and donates books
to our junior high library.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:57.790
He is also an advisor for
the Tokiwa Movie Society.

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:03.060
Well, um...
It certainly was a very old movie.

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.700
It's a film I thought was lost.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:09.400
This is the first time
I've seen it in many years.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.190
It's an unfinished work, though.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:15.980
The hero in the movie
couldn't have been you, sir?

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:18.050
I was the writer and leading actor.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:20.150
It's very embarrassing.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:22.280
It must have been
quite boring to you.

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:27.740
Not at all, I was very touched.
They looked like real lovers.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.030
Yes, I felt the same way.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:35.170
You know, when I was filming,
I was very much in love.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.340
With the heroine?

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:40.570
Yes. She was the "Flower" of
the university at that time.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.670
All of us admired her.

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:47.460
So, I asked people to persuade
her to be in the movie.

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:50.620
I can't say that was my
only intention though.

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:53.860
Still, why was the
movie never completed?

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:57.720
For some reason,
she quit school.

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:00.590
Since then,
I lost contact with her.

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:06.500
The feelings I tried to convey in the
movie have also been cut off.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:11.190
So my feelings
have yet to be fulfilled.

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:14.930
But that was a long time ago.

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:17.600
It's just a memory.

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:28.320
It was a good story.

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:29.870
But weren't you asleep, Yukari?

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.660
I don't like love story movies.

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:36.060
I meant the story he told us,
not the movie.

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:40.060
A love beyond time, huh?
How romantic!

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:41.900
What?

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:44.230
What's the matter, Hisae?

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:46.870
The woman who played the heroine.

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:49.400
I was just wondering what
she's doing nowadays.

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:51.200
She's probably a grandma by now.

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:54.440
She'd be caring for her grandchildren
in an ordinary family.

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:55.460
You think so?

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:58.560
I would think she
hasn't forgotten yet.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:03.020
She probably knew what Mr. Oshima
wanted to convey in the movie.

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:04.260
That's why...

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:05.360
Maybe so.

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:08.700
He didn't say he
loved her until the end.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:13.100
Hey, why don't we find the
heroine and bring her to see him?

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.360
Like those surprise
reunions on TV shows!

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:17.070
Do you think we could do it?

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:19.110
Do you think it would
make Mr. Oshima happy?

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:21.940
Yes!
What do you think, Miyu?

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:24.370
I don't think it is a good idea.

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:25.280
Why not?

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:28.810
Memories are
better left as memories.

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:32.850
But Mr. Oshima appeared sad.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:35.430
It seems like he's
still in love with her.

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:42.120
I just want to help him fulfill his
feelings, instead of using a movie.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:45.230
All right,
let's try to find out where she is!

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:48.530
After that,
it's up to him to do something.

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:51.980
It's settled!
This is gonna be exciting!

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:18.660
Haven't you
straightened things up yet?

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:21.160
It's not that easy, you know.

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.840
Ryosuke and his family
are coming next week.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:26.010
Coming back, is he?

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:28.900
He said he would pay rent.

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:31.850
What complaints could you
have about living with his family?

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.340
I have no complaints. It's just...

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:38.950
I have a lot of memories in this house.

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:42.480
I have only horrible
memories of this house.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:47.690
Mr. Taniguchi of
Meikei University called.

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:50.430
Is it true you declined his offer?

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:54.830
Yeah. I just can't teach
classes outside of my specialty.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:58.600
Even though they offered
you a professors seat!

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:04.920
A mere assistant professor, you should
be thankful to be offered a new job!

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:08.610
Are you aware that there is only one
year before you are out of a job?

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:12.720
Do you seriously think you are in
a position to pick and choose?

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:17.830
My lord! Why I ever...!

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:34.470
If I had known then...

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.340
I never even thought of yearbooks!

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:47.680
Since she was a student
at Tokiwa University...

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:50.200
there's a high possibility she
graduated from this junior high.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:51.690
Found it!

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:53.680
Kayoko Sudou.

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:56.360
But wouldn't her address
be different now?

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:58.890
Look, she went to Tokiwa high school.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:02.290
Hisae, you can use the
high school library, right?

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:04.710
Sure, we borrow books
from them now and again.

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:06.930
Let's trace these
clues one at a time.

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:08.370
If we gather enough information...

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:09.710
we can figure out
what happened to her.

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.980
I wish Miyu would help us.

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:13.780
No good to force her.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:24.460
So they've arrived?

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:32.430
Mom, you look troubled.

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:34.590
Dad isn't as stubborn as
he makes himself out to be.

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:36.610
I won't allow him to complain.

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:41.440
I'm the one who has supported us
and this house is in my name.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.000
Do you think it's alright?

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:44.650
Moving his stuff without asking?

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:46.110
It doesn't matter!

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:05.260
What is the meaning of this?!

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:09.640
I threw away everything.
You won't need any of that stuff now.

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:13.030
Besides, you're not teaching
that movie class anymore.

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:16.020
Ryosuke and his family will use
this room starting next week.

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:32.290
Where is it?
Where did she put it?!

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:36.530
There it is!

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:41.910
Did you find your memory?

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:45.380
You're from... the screening?

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:49.570
I don't think it's bad
to live in a memory...

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:53.510
but a Shinma dwells in the film.

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:57.090
I have no idea what
you are talking about.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:58.780
Excuse me.

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:09.460
I knew you'd be here.

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:18.570
Larva!

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:23.370
Larva!

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.260
Flame!

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:40.450
Larva, are you all right?

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:41.100
Yes.

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:44.570
But she's a shadow.
My powers have no effect on her.

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:48.410
You're right.
We'll need another plan.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:00.910
It should be around here.

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:03.610
Could it be the wrong street number?

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:05.820
Wait, isn't this it?

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:08.720
That's right but... what?

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:09.890
Oshima Residence

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:10.960
Oshima Residence
It can't be...

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:11.290
Oshima Residence

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:12.520
Mr. Oshima's?

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:14.360
Don't be silly.

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:20.330
Excuse me, but is this
the Oshima residence?

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:24.840
Yes, it is.
However, my husband is still asleep.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:28.020
Excuse me, but
is a Ms. Kayoko Sudou...

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:33.690
That was my name before I married.
Is there something I can do for you?

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:35.520
Oh, I...

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:40.310
It's nothing.
Sorry to have bothered you.

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:45.730
What does this mean?
Is the heroine his wife!

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:47.380
Looks that way.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:49.390
Then, why did Mr. Oshima?

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:52.260
I have one more clue.

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:56.170
Since we've come this far, I won't be
satisfied until I get all the details.

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:57.140
Let's go!

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:29.070
So you noticed.

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:33.660
Do you know why this has happened?

00:14:34.610 --> 00:14:36.010
What on earth is it?

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:39.380
All of them were swallowed.

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:42.120
All they did was watch the film!

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:45.120
Shinma.

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:48.180
Beings who's purpose
is to destroy humans.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:56.160
Yes, it was the year I graduated.

00:14:56.570 --> 00:15:00.410
Oshima married Kayoko while
they were still students.

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:02.900
Her family was very rich.

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:06.510
They were opposed to the
marriage, so they eloped.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:08.910
That's why the movie
went unfinished, right?

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:14.320
Oshima had a dream
to become a scholar.

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:20.310
Kayoko worked hard to support him,
but hardships can change people.

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:25.130
Now Kayoko probably sees
Oshima as an eccentric scholar

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:28.250
and a husband who
failed to succeed in life.

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:32.560
The lesson there is that
people cannot live in a dream.

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:37.010
But without a dream, there is
no meaning to life, is there?

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:38.670
I suppose.

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:42.410
For you young people,
that's very true.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.240
I'm afraid I have
destroyed your dreams.

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:47.880
No, you didn't.
Thank you very much.

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:52.910
I'm sorry, Hisae.
We've gone too far.

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:56.090
I didn't intend on finding this.

00:15:56.860 --> 00:16:01.520
No, I think Mr. Oshima
still loves his wife.

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:04.740
That's why he still won't
give up his memories.

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:07.760
At least I'd think so.

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:15.950
I've made a horrible mistake.

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:19.620
I should have been
satisfied with watching her.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:24.640
Because I got her,
I made her unhappy.

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:28.150
And I'm still chasing
the girl in my memory.

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:32.590
Because of that,
I made another mistake.

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.130
I involved a lot of
other people as well.

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:39.970
Your will was a bit too strong.
That's all.

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:44.110
The one to blame is the Shinma in the
film, taking advantage of you.

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:47.170
No, I knew.

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:18.330
I wanted to keep this film for myself.
So, I didn't stop the Shinma.

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:24.050
But now the Shinma has
started to devour your memory.

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:27.870
If it's not stopped,
more people will be swallowed by it.

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:29.810
You're right.

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:33.650
Even my wife, Kayoko!

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:36.260
I have to pay for my mistakes!

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:43.190
GEN-EH

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:46.930
As I suspected,
she has possessed Mr. Oshima.

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:50.650
That's enough!
Take me now!

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:53.740
Take me to the world
beyond the screen!

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.180
Take me to the
memory that captivates me!

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:13.120
She's in the film.

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:15.700
We have no choice but to follow.

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:36.280
Please be careful.
This is her world.

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:38.910
Will my powers work?

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:44.390
What a strange feeling.
It's making me uneasy.

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:46.090
Miyu, there!

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.230
She's very fast!

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:01.450
Flame!

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:06.810
There's no way to beat it.

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:09.890
Where there is light,
you cannot erase the shadow.

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:13.110
That's it... that's only a reflection.

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:41.150
Now, you can't escape.
Or, do you want to hide in the dark?

00:19:48.190 --> 00:19:49.950
Stray Shinma, return to the dark!

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:23.250
Everything is fine now.
We burned it from the inside out.

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:27.400
Were the people burned as well?

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:35.230
You know that's not my job.
I have no intention to judge humans.

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:06.960
Is something the matter?

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:21.300
Oh, it feels like I've been
dreaming for a long time.

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:24.090
I've made up my mind.

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:26.950
I'll stay with you forever.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:28.950
Will it be a bother for you?

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:35.950
No. You've always been with me.

00:21:38.470 --> 00:21:40.760
And now, as well.

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:58.240
The Shinma is destroyed...
but no one returned from the memory.

00:22:11.800 --> 00:22:16.930
The door opens
and before me is eternity.

00:22:17.840 --> 00:22:23.500
Whose voice calls from so far away?

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:30.850
Someone smoothes down my hair.
Who are you?

00:22:34.220 --> 00:22:38.210
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for...

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:42.790
Where time and my feelings pass by.

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:46.530
I don't need friends.

00:22:46.600 --> 00:22:47.330
That's a lie.

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:50.730
I don't even need myself.

00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:51.640
It's the truth.

00:22:52.040 --> 00:22:59.950
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away.

00:23:03.390 --> 00:23:07.560
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth.

00:23:07.660 --> 00:23:15.400
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky.

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:24.730
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain.

00:23:25.310 --> 00:23:32.070
In my place, the sky cries.

00:25:04.710 --> 00:25:09.170
The night is our world where
anything strange can happen.

00:25:09.680 --> 00:25:13.370
But that night, someone
bared her fangs at me.

00:25:14.420 --> 00:25:18.620
Was it a human pretending to be
in our clan or something else?

00:25:19.360 --> 00:25:20.450
It doesn't matter.

00:25:20.560 --> 00:25:23.500
I won't allow this creature
to come into my domain.

00:25:24.260 --> 00:25:27.590
Vampire Princess Miyu: Ghost of Miyu

00:25:28.530 --> 00:25:31.900
If you fight on the side of darkness,
you will be punished.
